# name: Marta
Marta opens the tin box. Inside is grey ash, fine as flour.
"My husband rowed this ferry for forty years. He wanted to be put in the river from the middle of it, on the last night. Will you stop for me?" # speaker: marta
* [Ship the oars and stop.]
  # fx: set-flag(flag: marta-stopped, to: true)
  The ferry turns slowly on the current. She tips the box over the side, and the river takes him without a sound.
  "There," she says. "Now he can go on rowing." # speaker: marta
* ["We can't stop here."]
  # fx: set-flag(flag: marta-kept, to: true)
  She closes the box and holds it tighter.
  "Another night, then." # speaker: marta
- The current takes you on.
-> END
